WEBVTT

00:00:26.020 --> 00:00:28.360
Hey...

00:00:28.360 --> 00:00:30.760
Wanna have some fun?

00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:34.990
What's going on!?

00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:41.370
Y- you!! What're you doing!?

00:00:41.370 --> 00:00:43.040
Nothing, really...

00:00:43.040 --> 00:00:46.370
Y- you're a wanted man...,

00:00:46.370 --> 00:00:49.380
Gyanza!! You must be Gyanza Rujikke!!

00:00:49.380 --> 00:00:51.710
And if I am?

00:00:51.710 --> 00:00:55.380
Don't resist! We're taking
you into custody!!

00:00:55.380 --> 00:00:57.050
Really?

00:00:57.050 --> 00:01:00.050
Then, try and catch me.

00:01:04.990 --> 00:01:06.660
Wh- where is he!?

00:01:06.660 --> 00:01:08.360
Where're you hiding, Gyanza!?

00:01:09.660 --> 00:01:12.000
I'm right here...

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:15.000
Hmm? You dickwads're IBI agents?

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:19.670
Then, do you know a man
named Sven Vollfied?

00:01:19.670 --> 00:01:22.010
N- no, I don't...

00:01:22.010 --> 00:01:24.010
I don't know him!

00:01:24.010 --> 00:01:28.180
I see, got it. Good-bye.

00:01:36.020 --> 00:01:38.690
Sven Vollfied...

00:01:38.690 --> 00:01:42.290
I swear I'm gonna kill you!!

00:01:46.870 --> 00:01:52.540
<i>That's how it always starts...</i>
<i>under the azure sky</i>

00:01:52.540 --> 00:01:59.710
<i>After making a vow,</i>
<i>I now set off</i>

00:02:12.330 --> 00:02:18.830
<i>Yeah, the desert glitters with a golden hue</i>
<i>(The wind is scorching)</i>

00:02:18.830 --> 00:02:25.170
<i>I'm searching for a diamond flower</i>
<i>(I keep on wandering)</i>

00:02:25.170 --> 00:02:31.510
<i>Now, for the first time in my life,</i>

00:02:31.510 --> 00:02:37.850
<i>I live for someone else</i>

00:02:37.850 --> 00:02:44.360
<i>There's something</i>
<i>I wanna protect</i>

00:02:44.360 --> 00:02:50.870
<i>I'll never,</i>
<i>ever lose it again</i>

00:02:50.870 --> 00:02:53.870
<i>Resound,</i>
<i>my heartbeat!</i>

00:02:53.870 --> 00:03:03.870
<i>A heartbeat smaller and fragile,</i>
<i>but tougher than anyone's.</i>

00:03:16.990 --> 00:03:20.660
"Charming Cat"

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:35.340
First off, this guy...

00:03:35.340 --> 00:03:37.340
Gyanza Rujikke!!

00:03:37.340 --> 00:03:39.010
You know him?

00:03:39.010 --> 00:03:43.350
Yeah. He's one of the men I captured
way back when I was an agent.

00:03:43.350 --> 00:03:46.980
He's a disgusting scumbag
who kills even women and children.

00:03:50.020 --> 00:03:53.980
So, what's this got to do with Gyanza?

00:03:55.030 --> 00:03:57.360
This...

00:03:57.360 --> 00:03:58.700
What's that?

00:03:58.700 --> 00:04:01.630
This is a bottle that contained Shinkitou.

00:04:01.630 --> 00:04:02.970
Shinkitou?

00:04:02.970 --> 00:04:07.300
That's right. It's a drink
that activates the power of Tao.

00:04:07.300 --> 00:04:08.310
Tao!?

00:04:08.310 --> 00:04:11.640
The uncanny techniques that you
were talking about the other day?

00:04:11.640 --> 00:04:15.310
Yes. After Igor at the botanical garden,

00:04:15.310 --> 00:04:19.980
the one that Tao user duo is after is...

00:04:19.980 --> 00:04:21.320
Don't tell me!!

00:04:21.320 --> 00:04:27.990
Yep. I'd like to take what's in the bottle
before it falls into this guy's hands.

00:04:27.990 --> 00:04:30.050
Can you help me?

00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:34.330
Wow, thank you!

00:04:34.330 --> 00:04:38.340
Then, I'll investigate
that Tao user duo, so...

00:04:38.340 --> 00:04:40.670
I'll leave Gyanza to you.

00:04:40.670 --> 00:04:43.340
What's with her!
"I'll leave him to you"?

00:04:43.340 --> 00:04:46.680
It's not like we have to help
that woman do her job...

00:04:46.680 --> 00:04:48.010
On top of that...

00:04:48.010 --> 00:04:51.350
Your fee'll be covered
by Gyanza's bounty, okay?

00:04:51.350 --> 00:04:53.680
That woman's annoying!

00:04:53.680 --> 00:04:57.020
The reward for Gyanza is 2 million gold.

00:04:57.020 --> 00:04:58.850
Can't complain about that, right?

00:05:04.630 --> 00:05:08.590
So, where's that Gyanza guy?

00:05:10.970 --> 00:05:12.970
That damn Gyanza!

00:05:12.970 --> 00:05:17.130
I'll capture him before he drinks Shinkitou!

00:05:17.970 --> 00:05:19.640
But...

00:05:19.640 --> 00:05:21.310
what happened to Train!?

00:05:21.310 --> 00:05:22.310
He's gone...

00:05:22.310 --> 00:05:26.650
Geez... As soon as I turn my back,
he takes off...

00:05:26.650 --> 00:05:27.980
Don't worry.

00:05:27.980 --> 00:05:30.750
He'll come back when he gets hungry.

00:05:34.320 --> 00:05:35.990
Oh?

00:05:35.990 --> 00:05:37.430
Hey...

00:05:53.680 --> 00:05:55.040
Throb!

00:05:57.010 --> 00:06:03.290
Looks like the rumor that crime's
getting bad in this city these days is true...

00:06:03.290 --> 00:06:05.620
Most of the stores're closed, too...

00:06:05.620 --> 00:06:08.720
The stores're closed, but you've got me!

00:06:13.300 --> 00:06:15.630
Let's see... where's a
milk vending machine?

00:06:15.630 --> 00:06:19.090
There's no milk vending machines,
but you've got me!

00:06:22.640 --> 00:06:25.310
I wonder if there's somewhere
I can get some milk...

00:06:25.310 --> 00:06:28.440
Okay! I got it! You've got me, so!

00:06:43.660 --> 00:06:45.330
Wh- what're you doing!?

00:06:45.330 --> 00:06:48.670
That's my line!

00:06:48.670 --> 00:06:50.670
Uhm, may I have your name!?

00:06:50.670 --> 00:06:52.340
Kuro-neko!
("<i>Kuroneko</i>" means "black cat".)

00:06:52.340 --> 00:06:54.340
Kuro?

00:06:54.340 --> 00:06:56.340
So, it's "Kuro-<i>sama</i>", right!?

00:06:56.340 --> 00:06:59.340
Oh, no! I'll be late for my appointment!

00:06:59.340 --> 00:07:01.950
Kuro-<i>sama</i>! I'm Kyoko!

00:07:01.950 --> 00:07:04.950
I'll see you if our fates meet again!

00:07:04.950 --> 00:07:08.280
Oh? My popsicle's gone! Where'd it go!?

00:07:08.280 --> 00:07:10.190
She sure makes a lot of noise...

00:07:11.620 --> 00:07:13.960
You're 30 seconds late.

00:07:13.960 --> 00:07:15.960
Please listen, Charden-<i>san</i>!

00:07:15.960 --> 00:07:20.300
I met this gorgeous guy today!

00:07:20.300 --> 00:07:23.300
When these bad guys were hassling me,

00:07:23.300 --> 00:07:25.640
he was all like Bam! Pow!
and defeated them!

00:07:25.640 --> 00:07:28.970
He's such a cool guy...

00:07:28.970 --> 00:07:31.980
Oh? My popsicle's gone again!

00:07:31.980 --> 00:07:33.980
Where'd it go? Where'd it go?

00:07:33.980 --> 00:07:38.310
But, Charden-<i>san</i>, what on earth
is up with this place?

00:07:38.310 --> 00:07:40.320
This town is terribly quiet.

00:07:40.320 --> 00:07:44.050
All the stores're closed, too.
It's so boring!

00:07:45.320 --> 00:07:48.660
If you have complaints,
please tell them all to Gyanza-<i>san.</i>

00:07:48.660 --> 00:07:53.030
Since he's been rampaging around lately,
the town has gotten quiet.

00:07:54.330 --> 00:07:56.000
Boring...

00:07:56.000 --> 00:07:58.000
Please don't grumble like that.

00:07:58.000 --> 00:08:01.270
Kyoko-<i>san</i>, it seems
that you're too carefree.

00:08:01.270 --> 00:08:02.810
What's wrong with that?

00:08:02.810 --> 00:08:07.940
You told me that this revolution that'll
happen soon is a festival, Charden-<i>san.</i>

00:08:07.940 --> 00:08:10.280
Yes, it's a festival.

00:08:10.280 --> 00:08:13.950
But right now we're
preparing for the festival.

00:08:13.950 --> 00:08:15.620
Preparing for it?

00:08:15.620 --> 00:08:17.290
That's right.

00:08:17.290 --> 00:08:19.960
So, in order for the festival
to be a success,

00:08:19.960 --> 00:08:22.630
we have to take our missions seriously.

00:08:22.630 --> 00:08:24.360
I see...

00:08:25.630 --> 00:08:30.970
So, this is the hideout
of this Gyanza guy...

00:08:30.970 --> 00:08:33.400
Anyone home!?

00:08:34.970 --> 00:08:38.310
Hmmm, there's nobody here.

00:08:38.310 --> 00:08:39.980
This is a problem...

00:08:39.980 --> 00:08:42.650
We promised to meet here today...

00:08:42.650 --> 00:08:46.050
If you're looking for big bro Gyanza,
he ain't coming.

00:08:47.320 --> 00:08:49.650
Is someone there!?

00:08:56.990 --> 00:08:59.330
Ah! My popsicle!

00:08:59.330 --> 00:09:02.600
We came to talk to you
in place of our big bro.

00:09:02.600 --> 00:09:05.270
Does that mean Gyanza-<i>san</i> won't show?

00:09:05.270 --> 00:09:09.270
That's right. That means our big bro
no longer has any business with you.

00:09:09.270 --> 00:09:14.110
I think he's found a girl in town
by now and is having fun.

00:09:17.280 --> 00:09:18.280
Excuse me...

00:09:18.280 --> 00:09:19.950
What is it?

00:09:19.950 --> 00:09:22.950
Aren't you cold in that get up?

00:09:22.950 --> 00:09:27.620
What's with this girl?
Are you jealous of my beauty?

00:09:27.620 --> 00:09:30.290
I'm not jealous or anything!

00:09:30.290 --> 00:09:34.300
By the way, we heard
from big bro Gyanza that...

00:09:34.300 --> 00:09:37.300
you guys have something good.

00:09:37.300 --> 00:09:39.970
Why don't you give some to us, too?

00:09:39.970 --> 00:09:41.970
Something good...

00:09:41.970 --> 00:09:46.640
Oh! You mean popsicles!
"Gunya Gunya Kun"!

00:09:46.640 --> 00:09:50.310
Look! See, it's so jiggly.

00:09:50.310 --> 00:09:53.320
This thing jiggles all over
but it's still a popsicle!

00:09:53.320 --> 00:09:55.320
This thing is beyond a popsi...

00:09:55.320 --> 00:09:56.720
Is this the one?

00:09:58.990 --> 00:10:00.920
All right!!

00:10:05.330 --> 00:10:07.660
Was that okay, Charden-<i>san</i>?

00:10:07.660 --> 00:10:10.190
Yes, no need to worry.

00:10:20.010 --> 00:10:27.350
Now I'll gain incredible power
like big bro did...

00:10:27.350 --> 00:10:29.880
This is so exciting!

00:10:37.030 --> 00:10:38.030
Hm?

00:10:38.030 --> 00:10:39.700
Nothing's happening...

00:10:39.700 --> 00:10:41.700
I forgot to tell you,

00:10:41.700 --> 00:10:45.030
that it only works for a handful of people.

00:10:45.030 --> 00:10:47.630
If it doesn't work...

00:10:49.040 --> 00:10:50.370
this is what will happen.

00:10:50.370 --> 00:10:51.370
Glibath!

00:10:51.370 --> 00:10:53.840
H- how dare you!

00:10:55.380 --> 00:10:58.110
You won't get away with this!

00:10:59.380 --> 00:11:01.990
What shall we do, Charden-<i>san</i>?

00:11:01.990 --> 00:11:04.650
Since it doesn't seem like
they'll just let us walk out of here,

00:11:04.650 --> 00:11:06.990
let's have some fun with them.

00:11:06.990 --> 00:11:10.990
Okay! Here I come, lightly-dressed lady!

00:11:10.990 --> 00:11:13.430
I'll warm you up!

00:11:21.670 --> 00:11:23.670
Man, that stupid Gyanza!

00:11:23.670 --> 00:11:27.680
I'm really fumed over his
breaking his promise with us!

00:11:27.680 --> 00:11:31.680
Ah! My "Gunya Gunya Kun" melted!

00:11:31.680 --> 00:11:36.020
Gyanza... He may have
taken his games too far...

00:11:36.020 --> 00:11:38.350
We need to keep an eye on him.

00:11:38.350 --> 00:11:41.760
Oh! Please wait for me!

00:11:54.700 --> 00:11:56.710
It's amazing...

00:11:56.710 --> 00:12:02.170
The Tao power's really amazing...

00:12:17.330 --> 00:12:19.000
Sven, what're you doing?

00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:21.660
I'm intercepting police radio signals.

00:12:21.660 --> 00:12:25.000
It's up to Train to gather information
in front of the station.

00:12:25.000 --> 00:12:26.340
That won't work...

00:12:26.340 --> 00:12:27.000
Huh?

00:12:27.000 --> 00:12:29.670
Train'll be back soon.

00:12:29.670 --> 00:12:32.680
--He's here.
--I'm starving...

00:12:32.680 --> 00:12:36.350
No matter how far I went,
all the stores were closed...

00:12:36.350 --> 00:12:39.020
Hey, Train, did you find anything?

00:12:39.020 --> 00:12:43.020
I'm starving because
I didn't find anything.

00:12:43.020 --> 00:12:45.020
See?

00:12:45.020 --> 00:12:47.690
Guess we don't have
any other choice. Here...

00:12:47.690 --> 00:12:50.590
Hmm? What's that?

00:12:52.030 --> 00:12:53.030
"Fishing"...

00:12:53.030 --> 00:12:56.030
Fishing?

00:12:56.030 --> 00:13:01.300
"Fishing" is one of the methods that we,
sweepers, use to capture our targets.

00:13:01.300 --> 00:13:04.310
You act as a decoy yourself
to lure the target towards you,

00:13:04.310 --> 00:13:06.980
and capture him.

00:13:06.980 --> 00:13:09.650
--I see...
--I see...

00:13:09.650 --> 00:13:12.320
So, why'd it have to be me?

00:13:12.320 --> 00:13:16.650
People don't go out at night dressed
like this in the first place, I'd say...

00:13:16.650 --> 00:13:17.650
There's no way I can!

00:13:17.650 --> 00:13:20.660
Gyanza targets women!

00:13:20.660 --> 00:13:22.990
Then, how about we decide it with this?

00:13:22.990 --> 00:13:26.330
Okay. If it's heads, you'll do it.
If it's tails, I'll do it!

00:13:26.330 --> 00:13:28.330
All right!

00:13:28.330 --> 00:13:30.600
I'll be the decoy.

00:13:31.670 --> 00:13:33.530
Wha?

00:13:36.340 --> 00:13:40.340
<i>I mean, there's no way</i>
<i>we can make her a decoy...</i>

00:13:40.340 --> 00:13:43.350
<i>Err, I mean, we couldn't possibly!</i>

00:13:43.350 --> 00:13:48.680
<i>I tell ya, err, I mean, I do declare I've</i>
<i>lived as a gentleman for thirty years!</i>

00:13:48.680 --> 00:13:50.590
<i>There's no way I can just sit back</i>

00:13:50.590 --> 00:13:53.360
<i>and let a jerk like Gyanza have</i>
<i>everything his way! Wouldn't you agree?</i>

00:13:53.360 --> 00:13:56.690
<i>My old lady, err,</i>
<i>mother dearest always said to me...</i>

00:13:56.690 --> 00:13:59.030
<i>"You have to protect girls."</i>

00:13:59.030 --> 00:14:02.300
<i>That's right! I'll protect</i>
<i>the women of the world!</i>

00:14:02.300 --> 00:14:04.300
<i>That despicable Gyanza!</i>
<i>Now that it's come to this,</i>

00:14:04.300 --> 00:14:06.970
<i>I'm gonna capture him no matter what!</i>

00:14:06.970 --> 00:14:09.640
<i>As a gentleman! No,</i>

00:14:09.640 --> 00:14:12.730
<i>as a "lady"!</i>

00:14:24.320 --> 00:14:27.480
Gyanza isn't showing up...

00:14:29.660 --> 00:14:33.120
I... kind of don't think he will.

00:14:37.000 --> 00:14:39.340
Oh, it's empty...

00:14:39.340 --> 00:14:42.570
Looks like I came a little too late...

00:14:45.340 --> 00:14:49.350
<i>Come out, Gyanza... Come out, Gyanza...</i>

00:14:49.350 --> 00:14:54.650
<i>Come out Gyanza... Come ou, Oh, wait.</i>

00:14:57.350 --> 00:15:00.620
<i>I wonder if I look like a woman...</i>

00:15:00.620 --> 00:15:02.290
Oh yeah, definitely.

00:15:02.290 --> 00:15:05.630
You look cute, really.

00:15:05.630 --> 00:15:06.630
Gyanza!

00:15:06.630 --> 00:15:09.630
Oh, Ma'am! You're so beautiful!

00:15:09.630 --> 00:15:11.970
How about working at my place?

00:15:11.970 --> 00:15:13.970
H- h- h- h- h- h- h- h- Hey!

00:15:13.970 --> 00:15:16.970
--Hey! You don't have to be so shy!
--Aaahhh! Leave me alone!

00:15:16.970 --> 00:15:20.310
Looks like this place is
as unsafe as people say...

00:15:20.310 --> 00:15:21.610
Yeah.

00:15:24.310 --> 00:15:26.710
I caught something weird...

00:15:29.320 --> 00:15:32.410
In any case, I think
the usual Sven's better...

00:15:34.660 --> 00:15:36.330
Was it that way!?

00:15:36.330 --> 00:15:38.660
Train! H- hold on!

00:15:38.660 --> 00:15:41.330
Sven! Come later with the princess!

00:15:41.330 --> 00:15:42.670
What!?

00:15:42.670 --> 00:15:44.790
H- hey! Eve, wait!

00:15:45.670 --> 00:15:48.670
F-... from underground,

00:15:48.670 --> 00:15:50.010
an afro appeared...

00:15:50.010 --> 00:15:52.010
Gyanza! There you are!!

00:15:52.010 --> 00:15:54.680
You broke your promise today, didn't you!?

00:15:54.680 --> 00:15:58.680
You promised that you'd join us
if your power awakens...

00:15:58.680 --> 00:16:02.620
Sorry, but I'm breaking off that deal...

00:16:02.620 --> 00:16:05.960
Ah! As we suspected, you planned
on breaking it, didn't you!?

00:16:05.960 --> 00:16:09.390
I changed my mind. What can you do?

00:16:10.630 --> 00:16:14.300
But I appreciate you guys at least...

00:16:14.300 --> 00:16:20.830
because, thanks to you guys, I was
able to gain this invincible power!!

00:16:27.980 --> 00:16:30.310
You have a cute face.

00:16:30.310 --> 00:16:34.650
It'll be cuter when
it's contorted with pain...

00:16:34.650 --> 00:16:38.990
I bet you'll be crying
with a sweet voice then...

00:16:38.990 --> 00:16:41.320
Stop right there!

00:16:41.320 --> 00:16:45.660
Now, come quietly, Gyanza.
I'm taking you into custody!

00:16:45.660 --> 00:16:49.000
Whoa! You came to rescue me again!

00:16:49.000 --> 00:16:52.340
Just as I thought,
you're my fate, Kuro-<i>sama</i>!

00:16:52.340 --> 00:16:55.340
Ha! A sweeper, huh?

00:16:55.340 --> 00:16:58.340
Aaahhh!! Help me, Kuro-s <i>ama</i>!!

00:16:58.340 --> 00:17:02.950
Kuro-<i>sama</i>! I'm dying! Save me quick!

00:17:02.950 --> 00:17:05.180
Let that girl go now!

00:17:06.620 --> 00:17:08.620
Aaaahhhh!

00:17:08.620 --> 00:17:09.620
What!?

00:17:09.620 --> 00:17:12.280
Kuro-<i>sama</i>!!

00:17:17.960 --> 00:17:19.430
Train!

00:17:21.300 --> 00:17:23.200
Princess!

00:17:26.300 --> 00:17:28.600
Gyanza!!

00:17:36.310 --> 00:17:39.320
You did it! Kuro-<i>sama</i>!

00:17:39.320 --> 00:17:40.810
Smoooch!

00:17:43.990 --> 00:17:47.320
Boy, you're shy, Kuro-<i>sama</i>!

00:17:47.320 --> 00:17:48.990
I'm not shy or anything!

00:17:48.990 --> 00:17:50.990
I guess it can't be helped.

00:17:50.990 --> 00:17:53.660
I'll save my kiss for next time.
In the meantime...

00:17:53.660 --> 00:17:57.000
You get a popsicle for your good work!
"Gunya Gunya Kun"!

00:17:57.000 --> 00:17:59.670
--Huh?
--Here, milk flavor for you, Kuro-<i>sama</i>!

00:17:59.670 --> 00:18:01.270
Strawberry flavor for you.

00:18:01.270 --> 00:18:03.940
And, tomato flavor for me!

00:18:03.940 --> 00:18:05.940
Hey, you're late.

00:18:05.940 --> 00:18:08.280
I've already defeated him.

00:18:08.280 --> 00:18:09.950
I was the one who defeated him.

00:18:09.950 --> 00:18:13.280
I'm sorry, but I ran out popsicles!

00:18:13.280 --> 00:18:16.350
Hey, let's hurry up and arrest him

00:18:16.350 --> 00:18:18.290
so we can get the reward money
and leave this town, Sven.

00:18:18.290 --> 00:18:20.620
Please take me with you!

00:18:20.620 --> 00:18:22.320
Sven!?

00:18:23.630 --> 00:18:24.630
Drat!

00:18:24.630 --> 00:18:27.890
Sven Vollfied!!

00:18:29.970 --> 00:18:32.640
I've been looking for you, Sven Vollfied!

00:18:32.640 --> 00:18:34.640
Long time no see, Gyanza!

00:18:34.640 --> 00:18:36.310
Be a good boy and let us
take you in without a fight!

00:18:36.310 --> 00:18:39.310
Don't make me laugh!
The hatred I felt then...

00:18:39.310 --> 00:18:45.480
I'll settle things right here,
right now... with this power!

00:18:46.320 --> 00:18:47.320
Tao?

00:18:47.320 --> 00:18:48.980
That's right.

00:18:48.980 --> 00:18:50.480
Sven!

00:18:56.330 --> 00:18:56.990
What!?

00:18:56.990 --> 00:18:59.690
Those hurt... a bit...

00:19:18.950 --> 00:19:20.620
This is fun!

00:19:20.620 --> 00:19:23.450
It looks like a game of whack-a-mole!

00:19:27.290 --> 00:19:30.960
<i>Though we're the ones who're being hit...</i>

00:19:30.960 --> 00:19:34.300
We don't have any other choice.
Train, do as I say!

00:19:34.300 --> 00:19:37.970
I know. You want me to aim
at his "right knee", right?

00:19:37.970 --> 00:19:38.970
What?

00:19:38.970 --> 00:19:42.300
I'm No. XIII, Black Cat.

00:19:42.300 --> 00:19:43.970
By watching his movements,

00:19:43.970 --> 00:19:47.310
I can tell that he's got
an old wound on his right knee.

00:19:47.310 --> 00:19:51.980
That's right. That's the wound I gave him
when I caught him a while back.

00:19:51.980 --> 00:19:54.320
Sounds like it's gonna hurt.

00:19:54.320 --> 00:19:56.320
But can you aim at it him
while he's like that?

00:19:56.320 --> 00:19:59.320
You'll be sorry if you
keep underestimating me.

00:19:59.320 --> 00:20:00.990
Okay, fine!

00:20:00.990 --> 00:20:03.660
I'm using a "burst bullet"!

00:20:03.660 --> 00:20:06.000
It's my turn now.

00:20:06.000 --> 00:20:08.830
What's with the relaxed attitude!?

00:20:10.330 --> 00:20:12.000
That's no use, Gyanza.

00:20:12.000 --> 00:20:16.010
My vision eye can see your defeat.

00:20:16.010 --> 00:20:18.010
Train! Aim at him, angle 4 o'clock!

00:20:18.010 --> 00:20:19.240
Okay!

00:20:35.360 --> 00:20:36.360
Precognition?

00:20:36.360 --> 00:20:38.030
Yeah.

00:20:38.030 --> 00:20:40.100
My right eye can catch a glimpse
of the world in the future,

00:20:40.100 --> 00:20:43.370
although only a little.

00:20:43.370 --> 00:20:44.700
Sven!

00:20:44.700 --> 00:20:48.700
Don't worry. I get really exhausted
when I use this ability.

00:20:48.700 --> 00:20:50.710
Splendid work, Black Cat.

00:20:50.710 --> 00:20:52.710
Oh, Charden-<i>san</i>!

00:20:52.710 --> 00:20:55.040
I've been looking for you, you know!

00:20:55.040 --> 00:20:58.050
Charden-<i>san</i>, this is <i>my</i> Kuro-<i>sama.</i>

00:20:58.050 --> 00:21:00.850
Oh, no, I said "<i>my"...</i>

00:21:03.650 --> 00:21:05.880
Y- you're...

00:21:06.990 --> 00:21:08.990
H- hey, give me more of that stuff...

00:21:08.990 --> 00:21:11.660
I wanna be stronger!

00:21:11.660 --> 00:21:13.660
It's no use.

00:21:13.660 --> 00:21:17.000
I didn't come to save you.

00:21:17.000 --> 00:21:22.730
I only came to see the end
of someone who misused the power.

00:21:33.020 --> 00:21:35.680
Allow me to properly greet you.

00:21:35.680 --> 00:21:38.690
How do you do, Black Cat.

00:21:38.690 --> 00:21:42.360
I'm Charden, one of the members
of the Apostles of the Stars.

00:21:42.360 --> 00:21:43.690
Nice to meet you.

00:21:43.690 --> 00:21:45.360
The Apostles of the Stars?

00:21:45.360 --> 00:21:46.360
Yes...

00:21:46.360 --> 00:21:49.920
It's a revolutionary group
led by Creed Diskenth.

00:21:52.030 --> 00:21:53.500
Creed...

00:22:11.290 --> 00:22:16.320
<i>The stars in the night sky</i>
<i>are my tears</i>

00:22:16.320 --> 00:22:20.330
<i>Goddess of the moon,</i>
<i>angel of the stars!</i>

00:22:20.330 --> 00:22:26.100
<i>Please stop time tonight!</i>

00:22:35.010 --> 00:22:41.020
<i>Please show yourself,</i>
<i>even if just a little</i>

00:22:41.020 --> 00:22:44.120
<i>Around the time the</i>
<i>first evening star appears,</i>

00:22:44.120 --> 00:22:46.790
<i>I hear footsteps approaching</i>

00:22:46.790 --> 00:22:52.690
<i>The only time I can see you</i>
<i>is when the moon is shining</i>

00:22:52.690 --> 00:22:55.700
<i>Please let me dream a little</i>

00:22:55.700 --> 00:22:58.930
<i>'Cause it'll become</i>
<i>an illusion by morning</i>

00:22:58.930 --> 00:23:02.300
<i>Even though I know it,</i>
<i>I still feel lonely</i>

00:23:02.300 --> 00:23:07.980
<i>The stars in the night sky</i>
<i>are my tears</i>

00:23:07.980 --> 00:23:13.980
<i>You held me in your arms</i>
<i>and your passionate lips met mine</i>

00:23:13.980 --> 00:23:16.980
<i>Please don't let go of me</i>

00:23:16.980 --> 00:23:20.320
<i>I'm about to melt in your arms</i>

00:23:20.320 --> 00:23:23.160
<i>But morning is almost here</i>

00:23:23.160 --> 00:23:26.660
<i>Goddess of the moon,</i>
<i>angel of the stars!</i>

00:23:26.660 --> 00:23:33.000
<i>I pray to you,</i>
<i>please stop time</i>

00:23:40.340 --> 00:23:43.330
"Next Episode"

00:23:43.680 --> 00:23:46.280
<i>To you fools out there</i>
<i>who're being controlled</i>

00:23:46.280 --> 00:23:48.020
<i>by an utterly corrupt secret organization!</i>

00:23:48.020 --> 00:23:52.350
<i>I announce that we, the Apostles</i>
<i>of the Stars, will change the world!</i>

00:23:52.350 --> 00:23:54.360
<i>A festival will start.</i>

00:23:54.360 --> 00:23:58.190
<i>A spectacular, bloody festival</i>
<i>to take us off the wrong track...</i>

00:23:59.030 --> 00:24:01.960
<i>Train... Soon you'll know...</i>

00:24:01.960 --> 00:24:02.300
<i>what my ideals are...</i>

00:24:02.300 --> 00:24:04.800
"Reckless Cat"
<i>what my ideals are...</i>

00:24:04.800 --> 00:24:05.270
"Reckless Cat"
